---
description: Andrew Stankus Agency site — keep the existing design exactly as it is
alwaysApply: true
---
Before making any change, read DESIGN.md in the repo root and follow it strictly.

- Do NOT change the look of the site: same colors, fonts, spacing, square corners, buttons and animations.
- Reuse existing classes and components; copy an existing section rather than inventing new styles.
- No new frameworks, CSS libraries or build tools. Plain HTML, CSS and JS only.
- Never edit generated files (events/*/index.html, events/events.js, data/site.js, sitemap.xml, robots.txt).
  Change content/, data/site.json or tools/build.py, then run `python3 tools/build.py`.
- If a request would require a visual redesign, ask the owner first instead of doing it.
